{#
    A toctree, as the list of pages it is.

    The one piece of navigation a Markdown file keeps, because it is not the
    site's furniture: it is what this page says comes below it, and it is how
    a program reading the twin finds the rest of the twin.
#}
{%- autoescape false -%}
{%- if not node.getOption('hidden', false) -%}
{%- if node.caption %}**{{ renderNode(node.caption)|md_line }}**

{% endif -%}
{% for entry in node.menuEntries %}{{ renderNode(entry) }}{% endfor %}
{% endif -%}
{%- endautoescape -%}
